<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"><B>Youlife Signs Strategic Cooperation Agreement
to Develop Industry-Education Integration Vocational Education Park in Ji&rsquo;an</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>SHANGHAI, China, September 1, 2026 /PRNewswire/</B>
-- Youlife Group Inc. (&ldquo;Youlife&rdquo; or the &ldquo;Company&rdquo;) (NASDAQ: YOUL), a leading blue-collar lifetime service provider
in China, today announced that its subsidiary, Jiangxi Youlan Sci-Tech Industry Development Co., Ltd., has entered into a strategic cooperation
framework agreement with Ji&rsquo;an Industry-Education Integration Technology Co., Ltd., the operating platform of the Ji&rsquo;an High-Speed
Rail New Area Digital Economy Industrial Park and a subsidiary of Ji&rsquo;an High-Speed Rail New Area Investment Group. Under the agreement,
the parties will jointly develop an industry-education integration vocational education park base to serve vocational education reform
and industrial development in the central Jiangxi region. The signing ceremony was held on August 31, 2026, in the High-Speed Rail New
Area.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>Industry-Education Integration Park Base</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The framework agreement has an initial term of
five years, with a five-year renewal period. Under the agreement, Youlife will receive exclusive operating rights for the Phase III Industry-Education
Integration Base within the industrial park, together with exclusive rights to introduce embodied robotics and related technology industry
resources into the park during the cooperation period.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The partners will collaborate across five strategic
areas:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; width: 100%"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<TD STYLE="width: 0.25in"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.25in; text-align: left">&#9679;<FONT STYLE="font-family: Symbol"></FONT></TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">Development and operation of the industry-education integration
base, including school-enterprise partnerships, teacher training, curriculum development, practical training programs, professional certification,
