<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; width: 100%"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 0.25in"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.25in">&#9679;</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">Industry events and ecosystem development.</TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The industrial park will provide the required
infrastructure, including office space, training facilities, exhibition areas, talent apartments, and supporting commercial amenities.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>Practical Technical Training and Digital Skills
Programs</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">As part of the collaboration, Youlife plans to
support the establishment and operation of an embodied robotics demonstration and training center within the park, providing hands-on
facilities for students and enterprise partners. Beyond the robotics center, the broader curriculum will focus on practical, application-oriented
digital skills, including digital content production, customer engagement services, e-commerce support, and other workforce training programs
aligned with industry needs. By integrating vocational education with robotics and digital skills training, the project is designed to
strengthen the talent pipeline for high-growth industries while creating new opportunities for enterprise collaboration.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>Management Commentary</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&ldquo;This agreement marks an important step
in extending our school-enterprise cooperation model into a full-scale industry-education integration platform. By combining our nationwide
vocational education network with the park&rsquo;s digital economy infrastructure and funding resources, we aim to build a replicable
model that connects the region&rsquo;s digital and advanced manufacturing employers with a strong pipeline of skilled blue-collar talent
development,&rdquo; said Wang Yunlei, founder and chairman of the board of directors of Youlife.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"></P>

