<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Mr. Wang continued, &ldquo;Our exclusive operating
rights within the park, together with our role in introducing robotics and related technology resources, provide a strong foundation to
expand our service offerings and deepen our participation in China&rsquo;s vocational education ecosystem. By leveraging our nationwide
vocational education network and the Ji&rsquo;an High-Speed Rail New Area&rsquo;s digital economy infrastructure, we believe this partnership
has the potential to become a scalable model that can be replicated in other regions as demand for skilled talent continues to grow. &ldquo;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">A representative of the High-Speed Rail New Area
said, &ldquo;We are pleased to partner with Youlife to advance the development of our digital economy industrial park. By combining vocational
education with robotics and advanced technology initiatives, and leveraging our RMB1.0 billion industry development fund, we aim to strengthen
the region&rsquo;s ability to attract innovative enterprises and develop the skilled workforce needed for future industrial growth. &ldquo;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>About Youlife Group Inc.</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Youlife is a leading provider of blue-collar lifecycle
services, dedicated to modernizing blue-collar employment through data, training, and technology-driven workforce solutions. In the talent
services sector, Youlife operates 180 domestic branches and more than 10 overseas offices. By partnering with more than 10,000 renowned
enterprises worldwide, Youlife provides stable and future-ready workforce infrastructure at scale. Under its &ldquo;School-Enterprise
Cooperation&rdquo; model, Youlife maintains a nationwide network of vocational schools, including 37 schools and 146 curriculum development
programs, covering 37 cities and counties across 16 provinces in China. For more information, please visit https://ir.youlife.cn/.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

